<!--
  dev up

  Builds the five jars and both images, installs the jars into plugins/, then `compose up -d`.

  THE ANSWER AFTER EDITING deploy/dev.env, and `dev deploy` is not: deploy restarts the existing
  container, which reuses the environment it was created with, so a changed setting that did not
  take effect looks exactly like a setting that does not work.

  The first run takes minutes - steward-worker fetches Paper, Velocity, the third-party plugins
  and the SMP's two world-generation datapacks. Watch it with `dev logs`.
-->
